+Actual retained MySQL CID `eefdd9a984ee00fe6ca886168b29a6ce4f3b405467b8d3204240d4e1a8dc7502`, loopback46653, 805306368 bytes/1 CPU; S3 CID `a91f5946d5f619335d5cfb6bf2295b1df46abbb4a75b2db8feccaf637bcb7d51`, loopback45501, 2147483648 bytes/2 CPU. Test/new JVM512 MiB/2 CPUs, native64 MiB/2 CPUs, retained PKI/private env only. Final selected-only inspect records both running/non-OOM and original limits/ports/labels. No new container, PKI, credential, DDL or environment reset.
+
+## Fresh final validation
+
+- `python3 tools/checks/run.py unit '*'`: **254 tests, 0 failures/errors/skips**, 41 fresh XML files, `final-allunits-01`, final unchanged380-Java source seal. This includes original CanonicalValueCodec, StoredSourceGraph, HashProfiles, ConfigBindings, RawHashChain, archive, parser, identity/API/security and Worker regressions; three draft-hash tests cover original independent goldens, complete marks/order and missing/corrupt archives/cancellation.
+- `python3 tools/checks/run.py it 'Task06*IT'`: **16 tests, 0 failures/errors/skips**, 9 fresh XML files in `saved-final-it-01`. Installed real LOCAL and S3 HTTP pipeline, 2 fresh-JVM original-hash/changed-current-default tests, immutable commands/stable reattachment, effective member/owner history, controlled same-root transfer consequences, all-six low acquisition dimensions, direct VALUES FK contention, S/F empty-mark change, rollback/lost-ack/CAS and winner recovery/future guards.
+- Additional `Task06WireHttpIT`: **1 test, 0 failures/errors/skips**, `http-boundaries-02`, actual 401/403/422/413, 206/416 Range and private no-store, platform-admin non-bypass. It was added after the16-case run; no product file changed. Total current distinct integration cases **17**, not sum of intermediate reruns.
