+
+## TDD chronology and evidence precision
+
+All failed runs remain retained; `verification-final/run-ledger.json` enumerates every receipt/XML window. Behavioral RED→GREEN includes absent hashDraft→golden; three acquisition/correction assertions; reader and immutable-write stubs→real pipeline; original minima, canonical preallocation, future installation and false capability advertisement; streaming wire parser; full-set admission defect (composition-probe-01 transferred ancestor body before measuring later content)→deferred all-content sets; and ordinary S-budget failure after concurrent acceptance→fresh winner lookup. Atomicity RED also contained a separate wrong outbox table-name setup error; it is not behavior evidence.
