+Setup-only failures are retained separately: Java name/import/type errors, a comma selector unsupported by the wrapper, unavailable dependency commands before `npm ci`, and `http-boundaries-01` using non-existent enum `ADMIN` rather than `PLATFORM_ADMIN`. `fresh-jvm-01` completed new-process/original-hash checks but failed LongNode-vs-IntNode comparison; the corrected round-trip assertion passed in the final16-case suite. No failures were edited into success.
