+The6 low-limit probes are supported by actual JDBC metadata/body-query assertions and fresh XML, not independently persisted raw SQL traces. DirectVALUES FK evidence supersedes the narrower earlier INSERT SELECT contention window. `atomicity-recovery-green-01` compiled before new Task06Process.java was written during execution; that unexercised new file is not represented as part of that window. Earliest reader RED also overlapped creation of an unused reader helper. Final unit380-source and final IT product-source seals have no such overlap. The initial pinned JdbcSavedTranscripts bytes were not separately saved: historical source.json proves its hash only; no reconstructed old snapshot is claimed. Root's additive pin begins exact byte snapshots.
